foundation.question_text:
Write $\frac{1}{2},\frac{1}{4},\frac{1}{8}$ in their left-to-right order on the number line.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=7cm,y=1cm]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(1.08,0);
\foreach \x in {0,0.125,...,1} {\draw (\x,0.08)--(\x,-0.08);}
\node[below] at (0,-0.08) {$0$};
\node[below] at (1,-0.08) {$1$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

